  "description": "Fuaran server-driven backend 1 (v1 default) — SSE-push + POST-receive over ASP.NET. The thin transport glue around the Fuaran.UI.ServerDriven core: an SSE IFuaranLiveChannel, the POST inbound parser, the connection registry, and the GET-stream / POST-event endpoint wiring (mapFuaranLive). Default because SSE+POST rides natively through proxies/CDNs/WAFs, gets per-event HTTP governance for free, and maps reconnect 1:1 onto the journal via Last-Event-ID. No platform-SDK dependency (the SSE framing is self-contained). Apache-2.0 licensed.",
